#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:2
msgid "Creating an HPE BMaaS Cloud"
msgstr "Crear HPE BMaaS Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:5
msgid "About this task"
msgstr "About este task"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:7
msgid ""
"Creating an HPE BMaaS Cloud integrates physical infrastructure into the "
"|morpheus| management plane, establishing a logical boundary for bare-metal "
"resources to enable group-based policies and proxy configurations. This "
"setup allows for onboarding HPE ProLiant servers for automated provisioning "
"and lifecycle management."
msgstr ""
"Crear HPE BMaaS Cloud integrates physical infrastructure into the |morpheus|"
" management plane, establishing a logical boundary for bare-metal resources "
"to enable group-based policies and proxy configurations. This setup allows "
"for onboarding HPE ProLiant servers for automated provisioning and lifecycle"
" management."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:9
msgid ""
"To create an **HPE BMaaS Cloud** in |morpheus| for HPE ProLiant bare-metal "
"operations, follow this procedure:"
msgstr ""
"To create un **HPE BMaaS Cloud** in |morpheus| para HPE ProLiant bare-metal "
"operaciones, follow este procedure:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:12
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Procedure"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:14
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Clouds` in the |morpheus| "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Navegue un :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Clouds` in el |morpheus| "
"interfaz."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:15
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`+ Add` button."
msgstr "Haga clic en el :guilabel:`+ Agregar` botón."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:16
msgid ""
"Locate and select the HPE BMaaS Cloud type as **HPE Bare Metal (BMaaS)**, "
"and then click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"Locate y select el HPE BMaaS Cloud tipo as **HPE Bare Metal (BMaaS)**, y "
"entonces click :guilabel:`Siguiente`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:17
msgid ""
"Enter the name, code, Labels, Location, and complete any additional required"
" details for the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Ingrese el nombre, code, Labels, Location, y completo cualquier adicional "
"requerido detalles para la nube."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:18
msgid ""
"(Optional) In :guilabel:`Provisioning Command`, select a Proxy for "
"provisioned bare metal instances if required, then click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr ""
"(Optional) In :guilabel:`Aprovisionamiento Command`, select un Proxy para "
"provisioned bare metal instances si es requerido, entonces click "
":guilabel:`Siguiente`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:19
msgid ""
"For the group, you may either select **Use Existing** or **Create New**:"
msgstr ""
"For el grupo, you puede either select **Use Existing** o **Create New**:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:21
msgid ""
"To use an existing group, choose :guilabel:`Use Existing` and select the "
"desired group from the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"To use un existente group, choose :guilabel:`Use Existing` y select el "
"desired group desde el lista desplegable."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:22
msgid ""
"To create a new group, select :guilabel:`Create New` and enter a group name."
msgstr ""
"To create un nuevo group, select :guilabel:`Crear New` y enter un grupo "
"nombre."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:24
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Complete` to finish creating the HPE BMaaS Cloud."
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Complete` to finish creating el HPE BMaaS Cloud."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/creating_cloud.rst:26
msgid ""
"After completing these steps, the HPE BMaaS Cloud appears in the "
"Infrastructure > Clouds list and is ready to have bare-metal servers "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"After completing estos pasos, el HPE BMaaS Cloud appears in el "
"Infrastructure > Clouds lista y es ready to tienen bare-metal servers "
"imported."
